A||N||27||87ECO5||What jobs are "safe"?||||5||
Z||000000||87ECO5||07-24-2001||09:54 AM||||I was just on the Corvette forum scoping out the "off-topic" section there.  Wow!  Two threads in two days involving "techie" people losing their jobs:<P> <A HREF="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/ubb/Forum26/HTML/028940.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.corvetteforum.cc/ubb/Forum26/HTML/028940.html</A>  <P><A HREF="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/ubb/Forum26/HTML/028797.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.corvetteforum.cc/ubb/Forum26/HTML/028797.html</A>  <P>Being in a "techie" occupation right now, I don't mind telling you I'm concerned.<P>I know it's tough everywhere right now.  But, I'm curious - what are the most stable occupations to be in?<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 07-24-2001).]||||reg||5
